# ==============================================================================
# StockVista Environment Configuration Example
# ==============================================================================
# 
# SECURITY NOTICE:
# - Demo Admin Login is STRICTLY DISABLED by default and never permitted in production.
# - Production bundles automatically reject demo logins regardless of environment flags.
# - Do not commit real passwords, GSTIN keys, or secret tokens to version control.
# 
# To enable Demo Admin Login locally during development:
# 1. Create a local untracked file named `.env.local`
# 2. Add the following environment keys:
#
# VITE_ENABLE_DEMO_LOGIN=true
# VITE_DEMO_ADMIN_EMAIL=admin.demo@stockvista.internal
# VITE_DEMO_ADMIN_PASSWORD=StockVistaDevPass2026!
#
# ==============================================================================
# Firebase Cloud Configuration (Firestore Database & Auth)
# ==============================================================================
# To connect Firebase:
# 1. Create a web app in Firebase Console (https://console.firebase.google.com)
# 2. Copy the credentials and paste them into your `.env.local` file:
#
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=your_firebase_api_key_here
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=your_project_id.firebaseapp.com
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your_project_id
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=your_project_id.appspot.com
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=your_messaging_sender_id
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=your_firebase_app_id
VITE_FIREBASE_MEASUREMENT_ID=your_measurement_id
# ==============================================================================
